      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1792426465807,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- RXJS - is really good for the transforms (pipe), etc.\n    - getting outside data in shape for the inside\n    - it is one of the asynchronous models in JavaScript (actually built in the browser now)\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- RXJS - is really good for the transforms (pipe), etc.\n    - getting outside data in shape for the inside\n    - it is one of the asynchronous models in JavaScript (actually built in the browser now)\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "zQiygr_wrAADJoU2MNPct",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1207.0305368031522,
      "y": 285.32209566571964,
      "width": 715,
      "height": 150,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0j",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 63048144,
      "version": 180,
      "versionNonce": 1511046096,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1792426641578,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Inside components\n    - use Signals. Period.\n        - no raw variables.\n        - observables are ok, but not good DX \n            - so glad I never have to explain $ or | async again.\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Inside components\n    - use Signals. Period.\n        - no raw variables.\n        - observables are ok, but not good DX \n            - so glad I never have to explain $ or | async again.\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
